# Striatum Gemini Extension (v{striatum_version})

This file is loaded as Gemini CLI's context when the Striatum
extension is active.

## Driving a Striatum workflow

1. Connect to the daemon MCP endpoint with the operator-issued token.
2. Call `tools/list`, then `session.register` and `work.await_packet`.
3. Ack the lease, do the work, publish the artifact, and complete through
   MCP `tools/call`.

